    "m12": "Low-light phone photo of a metal zipper pull and interlocking teeth filling most of the frame, hanging in darkness above a dark horizon line and partly lit by a dim headlamp.",
    "m21": "Flash photo taken from outside through a wide-open metal zipper in a dark fabric wall, looking slightly down into a small campsite: a compact dome tent, a dying campfire, two empty folding chairs, and a lit smartphone resting on a wooden log."
